Bundle-Name: Fennec Data Atlas - Runtime API
Bundle-Description: SPI between the Data Atlas bootstrap, the input configurators and the \
	endpoint configurators: the EObjectSource contract realized per configured DataInput, \
	and the shared service property constants.
Bundle-Version: 1.0.0

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.annotation.versioning;version=latest
